I'm trying to optimize a greedy function with OpenMP as a beginner. Unfortunately, I've tried several thing without success. I'm simply searching, for the first element of each pair in a vector, the index of its occurence (unique) as second element in the same vector. Here is my code : std::vector<int> function(std::vector<std::pair<int, int> >& pair_vector)
{
