According to your code, the scope of the parallel region, which is the scope where you define id, only includes the subsequent line, i.e. the line where you define id. Therefore, when you use the id variable outside, you get an undefined variable error. Besides, you are also getting an unused id variable warning because you are not using it in the parallel region (where you could use it). Most probably you just forgot to add the curly braces to enlarge the scope to be parallelized alltogether, i.e. #pragma omp parallel
