I want to use the reduction directive in openmp , but it's not working. Compiler error says: "reduction: OpenMP 'parallel for' empty factor in directive"
  (Visual studio 2015 community) or "reduction:^ needed scalar variable" This is my code (Byte is unsigned char ) void RotXOR (const Byte *s, int n, Byte *t)
{
