answers.body:
I test the code for single thread and multiread. And the result shows the multi-threaded code increase real-time memory usage. And the amount of memory added depends on how much memory is being consumed simultaneously in multiple threads. For example, single-thread implementation of code is as follows: #include <omp.h>      // OpenMP
#include<stdlib.h>
#include <memory.h>
